/* Chrome cookie sync for the cmux macOS app
 * (cmux-tui/crates/cmux-cookie-sync, src/ffi.rs): watches each imported
 * Chromium profile's Cookies database on this Mac and reports, as JSON on
 * the crate's own thread, which cookie domains changed since the app's last
 * import. It never decrypts a value and sends nothing anywhere; the app
 * re-imports the reported domains with its own importer and then commits. */

